      "role": "user",
      "content": "oh wow okay, thank you! i'll go grab the coconut oil now. i was really worried about using the drugstore stuff. so i should just put a really thick layer on and leave it? and you think it's okay if the redness stays bright red for a bit? i'm just worried about it getting infected since the blisters are kind of weeping a little bit already.",
